     "body": "An OpenAI API key (or any provider whose list has `sora-2` / `sora-2-pro`) can't make videos through magpie's `POST /v1/videos`.\n\n`catalog.textModel` drops ids containing \"sora\", so a Sora model is never listed for the provider, and the provider editor can't mark it a Video model (\"Makes…\"). `customVideomakers` builds only from what is listed or marked, so `filmsCustom` is false and `startVideo` answers 400 \"can't make videos\".\n\nFound while adding Ark-key Seedance videos (79911290c, axelburks on Discord asked for the gateway's video API). Not changed there.\n\nWhat would fix it: list Sora ids as video models for OpenAI-format providers (Films), so they go to `<base>/videos` in OpenAI's own shape, which the gateway already speaks.\n",
